flowchart TD
    A[Page access telemetry] --> B[MGLRU generations]
    B --> C[Promote hot pages]
    B --> D[Demote cold pages]
    D --> E[Pick victim oldest generation]
    E --> F{Anonymous or file page}
    F -->|Anonymous| G[Try zswap compress]
    F -->|File dirty shared| H[Writeback queue]
    F -->|Image clean| I[Drop page]
    G --> J{zpool full}
    J -->|Yes| K[Push to disk swap]
    J -->|No| L[Keep compressed in RAM]
